  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIDS Education and Prevention Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To influence positive behaviour formation in children of school going age through life skills classes and counselling.
2. To empower young people to make informed and independent decisions relating to relationship and their sexuality through counselling and information sharing - Education for life - Behaviour change programme (BCP).
3. To cultivate and enhance hidden or latent skills in young people to help them find their own solutions to their daily challenges.
4. To increase advocacy on issues that affect young people in relation to reproductive health, sexuality and HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
